From: armGBA speedups <none@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:00:00 -0500
Subject: armGBA: I/O stores from compiled code have their own slow path, with
 IE, IF and IME written directly (armGBA 2.0, 78ff173 and 216aa64, already
 applies IE writes that flip the H-blank bit at once)


diff --git a/src/cpu/a32/backend.c b/src/cpu/a32/backend.c
